example:
```diff
- SELECT * FROM Employees WHERE PhoneNumber = NULL;
- SELECT Name, Salary + Bonus as TotalCompensation FROM Employees;
- // Will incorrectly return 0 rows, or NULL total compensation if Bonus is NULL.

+ SELECT * FROM Employees WHERE PhoneNumber IS NULL;
+ SELECT Name, Salary + COALESCE(Bonus, 0) as TotalCompensation FROM Employees;
+ // Will correctly treat a NULL bonus mathematically as zero.
```

